check 1
# The items channel (specs/tools/scenario-diff.md §3 rule 13) on a monster
# kill: the seeds and the fallen of combat-kill-fallen (monstats 19, normal,
# Blood Moor after warp 2 at frame 4), two Fire Bolts kill it, then the
# items its death drops (S->C 0x9C, items/treasure.md) are compared item by
# item with 1.14d, bit stream bytes. The save's own items at join (none:
# no starting equipment beyond the class kit) come first in both lists.
name items-drop-monster-kill
save ScnAma --class ama --expansion
seed 1234
ticks 146
seconds 300
channels items
at 4 poke warp 2
at 30 poke seed-game 0x00001234 666
at 30 poke seed-unit @player 0x00000055 666
at 30 poke spawn 19 @x+3 @y+3 normal
at 34 poke missile 58 @x @y @x+3 @y+3 skill 36 20
at 40 poke missile 58 @x @y @x+3 @y+2 skill 36 20
